{"overview":"ساخته‌شده از رمان‌های نویسندهٔ جایزه‌دار جنایی آن کلیوز، «شتلند» دی‌آی جیمی پرز و تیمش را دنبال می‌کند که در جامعهٔ جزیره‌ای صمیمی به بررسی جرائم می‌پردازند؛ در این محیط منزوی و گاهی ناخوشایند، تیم مجبور است به سبک پلیسگری منحصربه‌فرد و خلاقانه‌ای تکیه کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Created from the novels by award winning crime writer Ann Cleeves, Shetland follows DI Jimmy Perez and his team as they investigate crime within the close knit island community. In this isolated and sometimes inhospitable environment, the team have to rely on a uniquely resourceful style of policing.","tagline_en":"Murder is only a ferry ride away.","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":1,"y":2024,"poster":"/hWyK0Gojr46pLSy76wg2ef9XDOf.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":2,"y":2013,"poster":"/8bGVbWY6sHDU478QVWWtk4LlHjR.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":6,"y":2014,"poster":"/cYLxMpXbkOZG8b3mhJeHFe0TkZJ.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":6,"y":2016,"poster":"/zyqMwRodfvXBAuvu5vLcYO7VMTL.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":6,"y":2018,"poster":"/Ak2KWUDfhinOTOVgZryxYnT2f5X.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":6,"y":2019,"poster":"/tU8X2UiTaShf59YKMTDcSdFdkeJ.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":6,"y":2021,"poster":"/rKnxmir8m5I3RdSTdZr3jaQaCZi.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":6,"y":2022,"poster":"/6jtzgUSpIyszkNE4LyxrX5zQCmY.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":6,"y":2023,"poster":"/frCCduyxPj01SI8VPBDKjeH2gu.jpg"},{"n":9,"name":"فصل 9","ep":6,"y":2024,"poster":"/6TTREk1miB6rep8A1PaFsMgmY71.jpg"},{"n":10,"name":"فصل 10","ep":6,"y":2025,"poster":"/k4BaXbXPYxSksFbvRYe7dKyYxZ5.jpg"},{"n":11,"name":"فصل 11","ep":4,"y":2026,"poster":"/v5iYsYdyIpmV7txv6tqz5mGBqdF.jpg"}],"episodes":59,"crew":["Ann Cleaves"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["GB"],"cast":[{"name":"Ashley Jensen","role":"DI Ruth Calder","photo":"/iDewhUriZzdJ2vbehTQD5cxi1yv.jpg"},{"name":"Alison O'Donnell","role":"DI Alison 'Tosh' McIntosh","photo":"/wnlXm7oUq2sogVUoZzbTxOGsHc4.jpg"},{"name":"Steven R